#. Description of the plugin
#: neotrendy-wp-hardening.php
msgid "Small, readable, secure defaults: blocks user enumeration, disables XML-RPC and application passwords, hides users from the sitemap, saves image sub-sizes as WebP and adds Site Health checks. No settings screen."
msgstr ""

